      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "573. 求下列各积的系数：",
        "1) $-8\\cdot5.1k$；　　2) $3.4\\cdot(-4x)$；",
        "3) $-1.3\\cdot(-7x)$；　　4) $-0.8y\\cdot(-4)$；",
        "5) $-10a\\cdot6.7b$；　　6) $5.1m\\cdot(-6.7n)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "574",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "574. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $-3.4\\cdot7.1-3.6\\cdot6.8+9.7\\cdot8.6$；",
        "2) $-4.1\\cdot8.3+2.5\\cdot7.9-3.9\\cdot4.2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "575",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "575. 解应用题：",
        "1) 两列火车分别以75公里/小时和90公里/小时的速",
        "度相向而行. 它们会车后5小时，相距多远？在它们",
        "会车前$1/2$小时，相距多远？",
        "2) 两辆汽车分别以60公里/小时和80公里/小时的速",
        "度相向而行. 这两辆汽车相遇后3小时，相距多远？",
        "在相遇前$1/2$小时，两辆汽车相距多远？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "576",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "576. 按下列程序计算：",
        "1) 求$a=-1.5\\cdot(-0.5)+2.7:(-1.8)$；",
        "$b=3.6\\cdot2.5-12.96:(-1.6)$；",
        "2) 求$x=-3.1a+7.4b$；$y=2.4a-5.6b$；",
        "3) 求$15xy$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
